MerkleAccount initialization
├── given an adapter registered in MERKLE_ADAPTER_FACTORY
│   ├── initialize while the factory creates the adapter
│   ├── create the latest account implementation with the adapter owner and configured role admin
│   └── approve the adapter for the vault's underlying asset
├── given an unregistered adapter claiming the trusted factory
│   └── revert InvalidAdapter and leave the account factory unchanged
└── given an adapter registered in another factory
    └── revert InvalidAdapter and leave the account factory unchanged
